# Butler Routes - Hillsbrad Foothills completionist pilot (pack butler-routes-completionist).
# Every Hillsbrad Foothills quest in the local census (37 quests,
# docs/hillsbrad-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept and once as a
# turn-in. Southshore opens as the hub (magistrate, marshal, scholar, farrier and
# chef all within two streets), then the Syndicate north, the murloc coast south,
# the Dibbs scholar chain, the seasonal pair and the east-side writs. Expedition
# legs carry the chains that leave the zone. Chain order is strictly turn-in-before-
# accept. Coordinates on Hillsbrad use the era frame; expedition stops use the era
# frame too, set with zone map lines. The Horde side belongs to the Horde block.
guide butler-routes-completionist/hillsbrad-foothills
title Hillsbrad Foothills - Completionist
levels 20-32
zone Hillsbrad Foothills
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
keywords hillsbrad, completionist, southshore
coords live
version 1

step Southshore - arrival

  tip Southshore (49.47, 58.73): Marshal Redpath holds the palisade, Magistrate Maleb (48.14, 59.11) the hall, Loremaster Dibbs (50.57, 57.09) the archive. Chef Jessen (51.89, 58.68) and Bartolo (49.43, 55.53) work the market street.
  accept 500 only Alliance -- Crushridge Bounty - Marshal Redpath; Dirty Knucklebones, the north hills
  accept 505 only Alliance -- Syndicate Assassins - Magistrate Henry Maleb; Footpads and Thieves, the north hills
  accept 536 only Alliance -- Down the Coast - Farren (51.46, 58.39); murlocs, the west coast
  accept 555 only Alliance -- Soothing Turtle Bisque - Chef Jessen; turtle meat, the river mouth
  accept 564 only Alliance -- Costly Menace - Darren Malvew; lions, the north hills
  collect 3668 @50.06,57.91 era -- the Assassin's Contract off the Shadowy Assassin for Magistrate Henry Maleb
  accept 522 only Alliance -- Assassin's Contract - the Shadowy Assassin @50.06,57.91 era; Maleb takes it here
  note 522's starter (the contract) sits on the Assassin in Southshore - take it there.
  accept 540 only Alliance -- Preserving Knowledge - Loremaster Dibbs; tomes, the north ogres
  note 540's pre (538 Southshore, done in Stormwind) fills before this route - take 540 here.
  note 95534's starter (the Singed Note) drops off the Syndicate Wizard north - take it on the north leg below.
  accept 659 only Alliance -- Hints of a New Plague? - Phin Odelic; Quae takes it in Arathi, late
  accept 92432 -- An Alarming Request - Emissary Jacques (48.33, 60.03); the Image takes it in Silverpine, late

step The north hills - ogres and Syndicate

  collect 2843 x9 quest 500.1 @48.2,1.1 era -- Dirty Knucklebones off the Crushridge Ogres for Marshal Redpath
  collect 2843 x9 quest 500.1 @49.6,1.7 era -- Dirty Knucklebones off the Crushridge Brutes for Marshal Redpath
  collect 3658 x5 quest 540.1 @48.2,1.1 era -- Recovered Tomes off the Crushridge Ogres for Loremaster Dibbs
  collect 213421 @59.7,7.4 era -- the Singed Note off the Syndicate Wizard for Kundric Zanden
  accept 95534 -- Strahnbrad Mystery - the Singed Note; Kundric Zanden takes it in Southshore

step Southshore - the bounty paid

  turnin 500 only Alliance -- Crushridge Bounty - the Knucklebones to Marshal Redpath
  note 504's pre (500 above) fills at this bounty - take 504 here.
  accept 504 only Alliance -- Crushridge Warmongers - Marshal Redpath; Warmongers, the north hills
  note The Worn Leather Book sits in a bookcase in Alterac - collect it on the Alterac leg below.
  note Kundric shares the turn-in with Shara Blazen (dual-ender) - Kundric takes it here.
  note Kundric shares the turn-in with Shara Blazen (dual-ender) - Kundric takes it here.

