  complete 505 only Alliance @49.5,19.6 era -- Syndicate Thieves for Magistrate Henry Maleb
  complete 564 only Alliance @38.8,24.62 era -- Mountain Lions for Darren Malvew
  complete 564 only Alliance @35.9,22.6 era -- Hulking Mountain Lions for Darren Malvew

