  turnin 505 only Alliance -- Syndicate Assassins - back to Magistrate Henry Maleb
  turnin 564 only Alliance -- Costly Menace - back to Darren Malvew
  turnin 95534 -- Strahnbrad Mystery - the Note to Kundric Zanden

step Magistrate Maleb - contract and demise

  turnin 522 only Alliance -- Assassin's Contract - the contract to Magistrate Henry Maleb
  note 523's pre (522 above) fills at this contract - take 523 here.
  accept 523 only Alliance -- Baron's Demise - Magistrate Henry Maleb; Baron Vardus's Head, Alterac
  note Baron Vardus has no spawn on 1424 (Alterac only) - take his Head on the Alterac leg below.
  note 512's pre (510 Foreboding Plans, Alterac, a future round) fills outside this route - take 512 here.
  accept 512 only Alliance -- Noble Deaths - Magistrate Henry Maleb; Alterac Signet Rings, Alterac
  note The Syndicate carriers have no spawn on 1424 (Alterac only) - take seven Rings in Alterac and have them in your bags.
  complete 512 only Alliance
  turnin 512 only Alliance -- Noble Deaths - the Rings to Magistrate Henry Maleb
  note 537's pre (525 Further Mysteries, done in Ironforge) fills before this route - take 537 here.
  accept 537 only Alliance -- Dark Council - Magistrate Henry Maleb; Argus mages and Nagaz, Alterac
  note The mages and Nagaz have no spawn on 1424 (Alterac only) - take them on the Alterac leg below.

