step Bartolo's cloak - the yeti fur (Tailoring)

  tip Bartolo Ginsetti (49.43, 55.53) sews on market street.
  when skill Tailoring 1

  accept 565 optional -- Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak - Bartolo Ginsetti; wool, thread, a cloak and fur, farmed below
  note The wool drops off-zone (Duskwood) and the cloak has no source in the data - have the Bolt, the Thread (vendor), the Hillman's Cloak and ten Furs in your bags.
  complete 565 optional @42.06,33.18 era -- Yeti Fur off the Cave Yeti for Bartolo Ginsetti
  complete 565 optional @42.27,30.53 era -- Yeti Fur off the Ferocious Yeti for Bartolo Ginsetti
  turnin 565 optional -- Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak - the bundle to Bartolo Ginsetti

step The Dibbs chain - tablets and fetishes

  note 514's pre (511 Encrypted Letter, Alterac, a future round) fills outside this route - take 514 here.
  accept 514 only Alliance -- Letter to Stormpike - Loremaster Dibbs; Prospector Stormpike takes it in Ironforge, late
  note 554's pre (551 The Ensorcelled Parchment, unowned - its chest sits in Alterac) fills outside every route - take 554 here or skip it.
  accept 554 only Alliance -- Stormpike's Deciphering - Loremaster Dibbs; Prospector Stormpike takes it in Ironforge, late

  note 95787's pre (95786 An Acquaintance in Southshore, done in Stranglethorn) fills before this route - take 95787 here.
  accept 95787 -- Take Two With Water - Loremaster Dibbs; four Tablets with no source in the data
  note The Tablets have no placed source in the data - have all four in your bags.
  complete 95787
  turnin 95787 -- Take Two With Water - the Tablets to Loremaster Dibbs
  note 95788's pre (95786 above) fills at these Tablets - take 95788 here.
  accept 95788 -- Magics of the Drowned City - Loremaster Dibbs; five Fetishes with no placed source
  note The Fetish droppers are unmapped in the data - have five in your bags.
  complete 95788
  turnin 95788 -- Magics of the Drowned City - the Fetishes to Loremaster Dibbs
  note 95798's pre (95788 above) fills at these Fetishes - take 95798 here.
  accept 95798 -- The Web of Magic - Loremaster Dibbs; Abra Cadabra takes it in Alterac, late
  note 95799's pre (95787 above) fills at these Fetishes - take 95799 here.
  accept 95799 -- Findings for the Explorer's League - Loremaster Dibbs; Historian Karnik takes it in Ironforge, late

step The seasonal pair - Hartman's watch

  tip Sergeant Hartman (50, 57.35) watches the Wickerman season in Southshore.
  accept 1658 optional -- Crashing the Wickerman Festival - Sergeant Hartman; scout the Forsaken's festival in Tirisfal, late
  note The Wickerman Festival comes once a year - Hartman waits if it is not running.
  accept 8373 optional -- The Power of Pine - Sergeant Hartman; Stink Bombs, right here
  note The Power of Pine runs on the same season - take it with the Festival above.
  collect 180449 "Forsaken Stink Bomb" @49.49,57.81 era -- Stink Bombs off the bombs for Sergeant Hartman
  turnin 8373 optional -- The Power of Pine - the Bombs to Sergeant Hartman

